keyframes.prompt_template:
Generate a high-quality {aspect_ratio} photorealistic vertical image for this scene's END frame. This is keyframe K{scene_index} of {total_scenes}.

CRITICAL: generate exactly ONE single photographic frame. No multiple frames, panels, sub-images, split views, side-by-side comparisons, storyboard grids, comic-strip layouts, triptychs, or before-and-after compositions. ONE continuous photograph, ONE camera, ONE moment.

