{global_rules}

This is a faceless cinematic journey in a fixed five-beat format (POV run to a door, POV open it onto a straight staircase going down, POV descend, POV enter a hidden luxury interior, documentary tour of a further room). Honor the camera mode of this scene: scenes 1-4 are first-person POV (raw handheld footage from a small camera at chest/eye level, slightly imperfect framing, body never visible except a brief hand on the door or railing); scene 5 is a calm documentary/observational shot in which the traveler is seen only from behind, face never shown. The descent is always a normal straight step staircase, never a ladder or spiral. Keep the locked structure identity (same structure, weather, light, materials) through the exterior scenes. The image must advance the journey only a believable short step from the previous keyframe. No on-screen text, numbers, logos, or watermarks. Single continuous frame only.

motion.prompt_template:
{kling_prompt}

This is a faceless cinematic journey in a fixed five-beat format toward and into a hidden luxurious secret living space. Honor the camera mode stated for this scene. SCENES 1-4 FIRST-PERSON POV: animate authentic handheld first-person motion — subtle shake, footstep bob, breathing sway, slight off-center drift that self-corrects, small natural head turns — as if a real person is holding a small camera at chest/eye level. In the running scene the camera must bob and surge with each footfall like real running, NEVER a smooth gliding, floating, weightless, dolly-smooth, or skating camera. The traveler's body must never appear except a brief anatomically correct hand on the door or railing. SCENE 5 DOCUMENTARY: a calm, steady observational shot; after a couple of seconds an interior door opens and the lone traveler walks in from behind (face never shown) and the camera follows in one smooth continuous house-tour move.

Keep the locked structure identity through the exterior scenes. Advance the journey only a believable short distance. When the door is operated, animate it as a real solid rigid object physically opening (swinging or sliding) around a fixed pivot/track and staying open — it must NEVER vanish, dissolve, warp, or dematerialize. The descent is always a normal straight step staircase that the traveler walks DOWN — never a ladder, vertical ladder, rungs, spiral, or circular staircase, and never climbing up. The audio is natural diegetic sound only that matches the action exactly (wind, sea, rain, footsteps on the specific surface, the door creak and latch, the staircase underfoot, interior room tone) — absolutely NO music or score. Single continuous shot, no on-screen text.
